        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SECTION 13.1.2. On one's return from any absence taken without making written application or receiving leave in accordance with the above stated requirements, the Company may waive such requirements in event it is satisfied that such leave was occasioned by an emergency or under such circumstances as made compliance with said requirements reasonably impossible.",
